  "details": "In the last update, object syncing between clients broke horribly. Now, it seems that objects aren't properly syncing between users, and two different people will see the same room of objects entirely differently. Take this instance, where the user in front of me is seeing the helicopter as a chair. It occurs between two different instances of PC, and especially PC versus Quest. I would consider this to be a major bug, as it ruins experiences in comfy worlds with screens, and many other worlds.",
